{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You\u2019re not dribbling the ball\u2026 <strong>you <i>are</i> the ball</strong>.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this physics-based 3D platformer, every bounce, roll, and leap is powered by <strong>realistic physics</strong>. Momentum matters, gravity is unforgiving, and mastering your movement is the only way to reach the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal? <strong>Climb a massive basketball-themed playground</strong> to reunite with your friends. The journey is filled with tricky jumps, narrow paths, and the ever-present risk of falling all the way back down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948040/extras/db33366473c0a9df3a694bbd5700e898.poster.avif?t=1756052573\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948040/extras/db33366473c0a9df3a694bbd5700e898.webm?t=1756052573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948040/extras/db33366473c0a9df3a694bbd5700e898.mp4?t=1756052573\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Two Ways to Play</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beginner Mode (With Checkpoints)</strong> \u2013 Take it step by step. Miss a jump? Respawn at the last checkpoint. Perfect for learning the ropes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pro Mode (No Checkpoints)</strong> \u2013 One mistake can send you back to the start. Only for the bravest ballers.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Compete for the Fastest Time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re a cautious climber or a speed running daredevil. Shave seconds off your run, discover shortcuts, and prove you\u2019re the fastest baller on the court.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948040/extras/9f24b0c05b9b6dcfda3e9ebe5e8f51e1.poster.avif?t=1756052573\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948040/extras/9f24b0c05b9b6dcfda3e9ebe5e8f51e1.webm?t=1756052573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948040/extras/9f24b0c05b9b6dcfda3e9ebe5e8f51e1.mp4?t=1756052573\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Can You Bounce to the Top?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The climb is tough, the falls are brutal, but nothing beats the victory of finally making it to your basketball friends at the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3948040?t=1756052573","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948040/7249d9b8d63721d93af3357010e5e4408c96cd82/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756052573","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948040/218342f543328b16730765c615e22d6e85d590c5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756052573","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948040/218342f543328b16730765c615e22d6e85d590c5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756052573","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save A